  "summary": "Convertible (19467) rear deck lid control: the release handle/control assembly on the underside of the folding-top compartment lid (the rear deck lid behind the seats) with rods running out to the lid locks at each side, plus the lever, stop and guide linkage (View B) and the cable to the lock (View A). The control is screwed to the lid inner panel; the rods are held to the lid by clips and a clamp, and the lever pivots on a screw. Pivots get 1b lubricant.",
